Many Christmas stories have been adapted to feature films and TV specials,
and have been broadcast and repeated many times on television.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Since the popularization of home video in the 1980s, these films are sold
and re-sold every year during the holiday shopping season.

12
